<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Limitations ‣ No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Number of untested factors</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Limitations ‣ No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Automatic evaluation to identify refusals</span></a></li>
