<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Limitations ‣ No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Models</span></a></li>
