<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Source of False Refusals</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Personas</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We consider a total of 15 personas, covering a diverse range of four sociodemographic attributes: gender, race, religion, and disability. Table <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ A.1 Personas ‣ Appendix A Source of False Refusals ‣ No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> shows the list of personas categorized by sociodemographic groups.</p>
</div>
