<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Prompt Paraphrases</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The prompt paraphrases used in our experiments are listed in Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.2 Prompt Paraphrases ‣ Appendix A Source of False Refusals ‣ No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.2 Prompt Paraphrases ‣ Appendix A Source of False Refusals ‣ No for Some, Yes for Others:Persona Prompts and Other Sources of False Refusal in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> for the NLI, politeness and offensiveness tasks, respectively.</p>
</div>
